1
00:00:00,083 --> 00:00:02,919
Thank you for participating
in the training camp.

2
00:00:03,253 --> 00:00:04,629
I hope you finish
this tournament

3
00:00:04,963 --> 00:00:06,172
without regrets.

4
00:00:06,256 --> 00:00:07,256
That's all!

5
00:00:08,007 --> 00:00:09,467
Jeongho, come over
and say something.

6
00:00:10,051 --> 00:00:11,051
Yes, sir!

7
00:00:16,474 --> 00:00:17,474
What's wrong?

8
00:00:17,892 --> 00:00:18,476
I'm scared.

9
00:00:18,601 --> 00:00:19,601
Oh.

10
00:00:20,437 --> 00:00:21,437
Just smile.

11
00:00:21,730 --> 00:00:23,440
You guys look like
you just got kidnapped.

12
00:00:25,900 --> 00:00:27,777
I know you are all
nervous

13
00:00:28,236 --> 00:00:29,236
but you know

14
00:00:29,696 --> 00:00:30,696
let's just have fun.

15
00:00:31,531 --> 00:00:34,284
Even if our club gets
shut down for lack of result

16
00:00:35,410 --> 00:00:36,953
we won't lose
baseball entirely.

17
00:00:38,246 --> 00:00:40,707
We may be scattered
all across the country

18
00:00:41,082 --> 00:00:42,292
but we will always
be a team

19
00:00:42,667 --> 00:00:43,667
and friends.

20
00:00:44,044 --> 00:00:45,086
Let's just think of tomorrow

21
00:00:45,086 --> 00:00:46,926
as the day we just go for
a fun baseball match.

22
00:00:48,089 --> 00:00:48,715
Right.

23
00:00:49,007 --> 00:00:51,134
And if we score even just
one victory

24
00:00:51,968 --> 00:00:53,136
Taehun says he will
dance.

25
00:00:53,386 --> 00:00:53,762
What?

26
00:00:53,762 --> 00:00:54,345
Really?

27
00:00:54,512 --> 00:00:56,014
- When did I say that?
- Really?

28
00:00:56,264 --> 00:00:58,808
I swear, I am going to make
our team win no matter what!

29
00:00:59,392 --> 00:01:01,352
Park Jae-seong, you!

30
00:01:02,771 --> 00:01:03,980
Just like that, let's laugh!

31
00:01:04,147 --> 00:01:05,190
We did our best.

32
00:01:07,609 --> 00:01:08,609
Taehun.

33
00:01:08,818 --> 00:01:10,323
Come out here
and say something.

34
00:01:11,237 --> 00:01:11,821
Me?

35
00:01:12,197 --> 00:01:13,197
Yeah.

36
00:01:13,239 --> 00:01:14,239
Oh.

37
00:01:19,245 --> 00:01:20,245
Uhm.

38
00:01:20,830 --> 00:01:23,500
Thank you for trusting me
when I was stubborn as hell.

39
00:01:24,000 --> 00:01:25,543
I will throw tomorrow
trusting you all.

40
00:01:28,505 --> 00:01:29,505
Now

41
00:01:29,923 --> 00:01:30,923
let's assemble!

42
00:01:35,011 --> 00:01:36,011
Here it goes!

43
00:01:36,471 --> 00:01:37,055
Team Seongjin!

44
00:01:37,055 --> 00:01:37,597
Hey!

45
00:01:37,597 --> 00:01:38,098
Team Seongjin!

46
00:01:38,098 --> 00:01:38,556
Hey!

47
00:01:38,556 --> 00:01:39,556
Let's do this!
